<title>USA: Videolan names Jack Shirman CEO.</title>
<headline>Videolan names Jack Shirman CEO.</headline>
<dateline>LOUISVILLE, Ky. 1996-09-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>VideoLan Technologies Inc said on Tuesday it had named Jack Shirman as chief executive officer.</p>
<p>Effective September 30, Shirman replaces John Haines, who left the company to pursue other interests.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
